# backend runtime state
#
# The catalogue, feature contract and climate fixtures ARE committed: they are
# small, they are generated from the TypeScript source, and having them present
# means the backend and its parity tests run on a fresh clone without first
# running the exporter. The training set is ~14 MB at the default 12 000 rows
# and the model artefacts are large binaries, so both are regenerated instead —
# see `scripts/export-dataset.ts` and `scripts/train-surrogate.ts`.
backend/thermal_shelter.db
backend/models/
backend/data/training-set.json
# same policy for the frontend copy of the backend data
frontend/backend/data/training-set.json

